+\paragraph{Developer weighting and absolute probabilities.} The main set has \RevNDevelopers{} developers and the
+additional-model set \RevFlNDevelopers. Model weighting first averages each model's successful pairs; developer
+weighting averages those model means within developer, then equally across developers. Neither targets a population
+of models. Endorsement remains first under both weights and every developer deletion. The released per-model CSV
